OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 19 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Choir of St John's College,
OL,6,     GCambridge, presents a concert as
OL,7,     Gpart of a five-day long festival
OL,8,     Gto mark the installation of a new
OL,9,     Gorgan in the College Chapel.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,11,     FSt
OL,12,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a turning-
OL,13,     Gpoint moment of five Black female
OL,14,     Gmusicians, revealing lesser-known
OL,15,     Gaspects of their life and work.
OL,16,     GToday she considers Big Mama
OL,17,     GThornton.
